Editing:
Todd Perkins
Barbara
Dave
Brain
Mouse
Jerry
Steve S.

00:23:46.900 --> 00:23:51.300
...from something to something to be created, to be born -

00:23:51.500 --> 00:23:56.200
Someone will give us an explanation for how that happens

00:23:51.520 --> 00:24:01.480
Subtitled by:
Central Anime(Kansas)

00:23:57.180 --> 00:24:06.350
It is something that intelligent people will figure out

00:24:06.900 --> 00:24:11.750
But the answer given to me when I ask "Why ?"...

00:24:12.050 --> 00:24:16.850
...is usually just a formulaic one

00:24:17.130 --> 00:24:22.140
What in the world is that worth ?

00:24:22.300 --> 00:24:29.200
If I ask, they only hesitate to answer

00:24:30.000 --> 00:24:40.000
Why you came to love me isn't something you need to explain

00:24:40.300 --> 00:24:52.900
Those eyes in which the auroras flutter can simply remain a mystery

00:25:10.650 --> 00:25:15.600
Preview of Next Episode

00:25:12.570 --> 00:25:17.950
In August of Imperial Year 482, after garnering battlefield accolades in battle on Kapche-Lanka...

00:25:17.950 --> 00:25:23.450
...Reinhard and Kircheis were assigned to space fleet duties in accordance with their wishes.

00:25:23.450 --> 00:25:26.200
Their new assignment was aboard a destroyer named Hameln II.

00:25:26.200 --> 00:25:28.950
What will be waiting for them during their new mission ?

00:25:28.950 --> 00:25:31.300
Next episode of Legend of the Galactic Heroes Gaiden...

